  "answer": "This feature has been requested before. The main tracking issue is PowerToys#1392, \"Desktop Icon Zones with headers for organization (aka fences)\". It asks for Stardock Fences-style grouping of desktop icons, and similar requests have been closed as duplicates of it (#8923, #34340, #34066, #17151). It is still open, and no PowerToys utility does this yet. Add a 👍 reaction and your use case, including the folder and stack-style expand/collapse behaviour, to #1392. In the meantime, use manually created desktop folders. You could also use a third-party tool such as Stardock Fences or Portals, both of which the tickets mention."
